      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Halfpast 1.2.1</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Rows without ends.</b> Every row now runs on past the day — into yesterday's last hours and tomorrow's first — and dissolves, so the day reads as a window on time that keeps going.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
